@startuml Walker and validating

!pragma teoz true

title Files gate and validator (details of the Import chain diagram)

control "groups\n(any source)" as Groups
box GateKeeper #LightSkyBlue
control "files gate" as Gate
control "exif" as Exif
control "mime" as Mime
control "validator" as Validator
database "DB (gorm)" as DB
end box
control "transcode\n(switch)" as Transcode

== files gate ==

Groups -> Gate: group []File\n(no main file yet)
activate Gate
Gate -> DB: files table by path:\nnew? size/mtime changed?\nCheckTime = this walk
Gate -> DB: item of the group Ready?
alt nothing changed and the item is Ready
    Gate ->x Gate: drop (no exif, no work)
else new / changed / not Ready (new, Dirty, interrupted)
    Gate -> Exif: group
end
deactivate Gate

Exif -> Mime: group + exif
Mime -> Validator: ranked group:\nmain file + sidecars
activate Validator

== validator ==

Validator -> DB: hash(size,\nexif without volatile tags)\nof the main file
activate DB

alt found the same
    note over Validator, DB
    same path and same hash:
    only reached when the item is not Ready
    (the gate drops the rest)
    end note
    DB -> Validator: <font color=blue><b>existing guid

else found moved
    note over Validator, DB
    same hash, different path,
    old path <b><font color=red>not exists
    The item may be deleted already (deletions ran
    first: the chain is async) -> restored
    end note
    DB <- DB: update path, new file rows\ntake the item's GUID
    alt outputs for the GUID complete
        DB -> Validator: <font color=blue><b>existing guid</b></font>, Ready
        Validator ->x Validator: done, <b>no transcode
    else something missing
        DB -> Validator: <font color=blue><b>existing guid
    end

else don't found
    note over Validator, DB
    path and hash not found
    create new item
    end note
    note over Validator, DB
    same hash, different path,
    old path <b><font color=red>also exists
    create new one (duplicate)
    end note
    DB <- DB: create
    DB -> Validator: <font color=green><b>new guid

else found changed
    note over Validator, DB
    same path, different hash
    <b>have to regenerate thumbs
    end note
    DB -> Validator: <font color=blue><b>existing guid</b></font>, Dirty
    deactivate DB
end

Validator -> Transcode: item (guid), group, exif
deactivate Validator
note over Transcode #LightGreen: then plugins; the closer sets the item <b>Ready</b>

== end of walk (the marker from every groups branch) ==

note over Groups, DB #LightGreen
The files gate runs deletions only after a <b>complete</b> walk with files found
(not on cancel, missing root, empty root).
Files with CheckTime older than this walk, under the root,
not under an unreadable directory, are gone:
- main file gone -> item <b>Deleted</b> (soft delete, hidden from /items)
- sidecar gone -> item <b>Dirty</b> (re-emitted by the next walk)
- file rows deleted
end note

@enduml
